# Go sources are gated byte-exactly against gofmt — the ci.yml gofmt step and
# internal/release's TestModuleTreeIsGofmtClean compare on-disk bytes with
# gofmt's canonical output, which uses LF. Force LF checkouts everywhere so a
# Windows clone (core.autocrlf defaults to true there) does not turn every
# file into a CRLF variant and fail the gate on all 100+ sources at once.
*.go text eol=lf
